Reviewer: freebuff. Date: 2026-10-23.

Subject: commit ee3538a.  The two files at HEAD are byte-identical to ee3538a:
  $ git diff --quiet ee3538a HEAD -- kernel/src/trust.rs kernel/src/trustselftest.rs && echo identical
  identical to ee3538a
