  PASS  ed25519 negative rejected: signature bit 0/7/100/255/256/263/400/511 flipped
  PASS  ed25519 negative rejected: message changed
  PASS  ed25519 negative rejected: S + L (malleable encoding)
  PASS  ed25519 negative rejected: R with y >= p (non-canonical)
