  PASS  all-zero public key + all-zero signature rejected
  PASS  RFC TEST 1 with S+L rejected

The whole run is 44 checks:

  SUMMARY: 44 passed, 0 failed, 44 checks

So the algorithm itself is correct on every vector I can obtain independently.


